msgid "Define qué tipos de archivos subidos al Chatter irán a cada subcarpeta de la Plantilla DMS embebida seleccionada y qué Categoría se les asignará. Al clasificar, dejará una nota agrupada en el Chatter del registro donde se subió."
msgstr "Define which file types uploaded to the Chatter will go into each subfolder of the selected Embedded DMS Template and which Category will be assigned to them. When classifying, a grouped note will be posted in the Chatter of the record where it was uploaded."

